OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh NHS in strongest pre-winter 
OL,4,Aposition ever, says health minister    
OL,6,FIn September, there were 4,900 patient 
OL,7,Fpathways waiting more than two years   
OL,8,Ffor planned treatment - a fall of 160  
OL,9,Fcompared to the previous month.        
